ency in Edinburgh, it was a pleasure to voice their showreel - Guy Harris\",\"uploadDate\":\"2015-04-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Homepage Showreel Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p></p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Homepage Showreel Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>I've been working with 20/20 Productions (an innovative production and creative agency in Edinburgh) for a while now. We've been working on a series of videos for a major retail brand, so it was a pleasure to be asked to voice their homepage showreel. They put together a fantastic 1-minute animated explainer video for their homepage and were looking for a natural conversational voice to suit the flow of the piece. I get more explainer video voiceover jobs than anything else these days and it's something I always like doing. If you'd like a couple more examples of my explainer videos, check out my <a href=\"/crowd-hub-x-explainer-video-voiceover\" title=\"Crowd Hub X\">Crowd Hub X</a> video.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NfoJJpELeQc","title":"Homepage Showreel Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/homepage-showreel-voice.jpg","alt":"Homepage Showreel Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Who are 20/20?</h2>\r\n<p>20/20 Productions has over 25 years’ experience delivering successful communication projects , using the latest technologies and techniques to ensure that your message is delivered clearly. They're an extremely impressive and professional company and a pleasure to work with. This relaxed tone is a style  I'm asked for daily. It feels much more suited than the hard sell for these explainer videos. Let the pictures and your product do the talking and have the voice simply guide it along.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for this type of voice delivery for an <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> or <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">advertisement</a>, please get in touch. I'll gladly send you a short voice a sample first to see if my voice is right for your project or brand.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Homepage Showreel Voiceover","pageUrl":"homepage-showreel-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","788",{"href":"/why-use-a-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/why-use-a-voiceover.jpg","alt":"why-use-a-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Why use a voiceover (Vo Artist)?"}]]}],["$","$L3","942",{"href":"/n